cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper and identify the version used."
title: "Golay constructions of Hadamard matrices of orders 2092 and 7516"
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/golay-hadamard-2092-7516"
keywords:
  - Hadamard matrices
  - Golay pairs
  - weighing matrices
abstract: >-
  Seven elementary Golay doublings give a real Hadamard matrix of order
  2092 through a weighing-matrix transfer. A complex Golay pair of length
  234 supplies a weighing matrix of order 1880 and weight 1878, yielding
  a construction at order 7516 without a pre-existing conference matrix.
  Binary companion inputs give orders 2572 and 4204. All four orders were
  previously known. The software generates the matrices and checks every
  pair of distinct rows.
